{"id": "DFbuOg5veGs", "title": "Video by visionmachina", "description": "Dior “Metal Muse” (Ai spec ad)\n\nIn a future where elegance defines destiny, the Metal Muse emerges—a vision of strength and grace. Born from a world of light and fire, she is adorned in a resplendent metallic reinterpretation of Dior’s iconic Bar Jacket, reimagined as a luminous armor that embodies both power and timeless sophistication.\n\n“Metal Muse” is a fictional, experimental Al-driven concept ad created to explore the possibilities of generative Al in visual storytelling. This project serves as a study in pushing the boundaries of art direction, design, and technology, blending creative expression with cutting-edge innovation.\nIt is purely a personal exploration and not affiliated with or endorsed by Dior. #ai #aivideo #aigenerated #brand #dior #klingai #midjourney", "channel": "visionmachina", "uploader_id": "71483437226", "uploader": "VISION MACHINA", "timestamp": 1738204521, "like_count": 9, "comment_count": 1, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1111966213749733a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 75.571, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQMei83hEzULaXeuru-PbKEX6kEbmOTHKpKdMf9vzRJtWzcXBbeQ_0w5YCSAmSb595kBQ2-Lm2gk7Bamj8nQcg8f.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_oc=AdrLY3djPrv4bf2JY4oTHYXiRV2Tn1Ay0xqUA1oHGkHefMn3bezobp20VdzpX7uR6hYqD3VOI7B0R_FPUF2nzNwn&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=H6OBXxwyMFwQ7kNvwFpjIQt&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=u3rMjPbYNkjuvIHONT6drA&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQ1AG8m-l9f0wOw